                    "voucher_access_usage": "PRINTED",
                    "temporary": false,
                    "description": "Buy tickets to visit Terra Natura Zoo. Discover the Zooimmersion, a new zoo concept in habitat design. Spend a lovely day with family and friends in Benidorm.",
                    "about": "Terra Natura is a next generation zoo where you can discover \"Zooimmersion\": a new zoo concept in habitat design that allows you to come into contact with the animals through barriers invisible to the human eye.The 320,000 square metres of the Benidorm Park are divided into four areas: Pangea, America, Asia and Europe.\n- Pangea: \nDiscover the mysterious and extraordinary world of the poisonous creatures. Come and learn things about the poison and the animals that produces it and uses it to defend and to capture their prey: tarantulas of America and of Asia, African scorpions, poisonous lizards, deadly snakes, up to small dart frogs whose simple drop of sweat can kill an elephant.\n- America\nThis is the area that will attract you most for this exuberant vegetation and the remains of the Mayan ruins where you can find numerous species of its fauna: the temple of life, an enormous aviary with a tropical forest inside where a walk through it is a pleasure for all your senses, accompanied by the presence of multiple species of birds; chatterboxes, peacocks, trumpeters, different toucans, golden orioles, parrots and others awaiting to be discovered by you.\n- Asia\nA landscape and a fauna that they you will transport you to the land of Asia: the land of the elephants with one of the biggest herds in Europe, the monsoon meadow where you will see other big herbivores of India live placidly in groups, or the territory of the Indian rhinoceroses, these zoological jewels of prehistoric aspect almost impossible to see in other places of Spain, the temple of the felines with tigers and leopards and some other animals, where they await you to discover their natural way of life.\n- Europe\nThe placid Mediterranean climate gives place an area where the typical animals of our fauna move freely; bucks, deer, boar, etc. they will come close to you in this contact area. Someone will let you touch the skin that you will find rough unlike that of a domestic animal.",
                    "meeting_point": "Partida Foia del Verdader, 1, 03502 Benidorm, Alicante. Car: on the AP-7 motorway, take exit 65 if approaching from Valencia or exit 65A if coming from Alicante. You can also get here by the N-332 highway. Access to the Park is well signposted. GPS directions: Avda. Alcalde Eduardo Zaplana, cross with CV-70. Bus: from Benidorm Loix area Line 1. Taxi: there are taxi ranks in both Benidorm and the park itself providing services to and from the park",
